# Red Hulk: "Whenever Red Hulk is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on him. When you do, he deals damage equal to the number of
# +1/+1 counters on him to any other target." The reflexive ability exists only if the counter was put on (CR 603.12). Turn 2: a
# first Lightning Bolt gives him a counter and he deals 1 to Bot2 (19). Then Bot2's Solemnity ("Counters can't be put on ...
# creatures") and a second Bolt: no counter goes on, so there is no "when you do" - Bot1 is never asked for a target, and the
# counter he already had deals nothing to anyone (Bot2 stays at 19, Bot1 at 20, one counter).

